{"id":153,"name":"Peroni","slug":"peroni-ks","logo":"storage/clients/peroni-ks-c6adf2709b.png","featured_image":"storage/projects/give-it-a-kiss-9e509a7bcc.jpg","title":null,"description":null,"website":null,"location":"locally","services":[{"name":"Campaign","slug":"campaign"},{"name":"S. Media","slug":"s-media"}],"industries":[{"name":"Produce","slug":"produce"},{"name":"Food","slug":"food"}],"projects":[{"id":178,"title":"Give It a Kiss!","slug":"give-it-a-kiss","year":"2021","description":"Launched as a campaign in Kosovo to boost Peroni beer’s market growth, the phrase Pi çka të freskon had such an impact that it even doubled sales in Albania. A printed billboard went viral in the digital world.","body_html":null,"cover_image":"storage/projects/give-it-a-kiss-9e509a7bcc.jpg","is_featured":true,"services":["Campaign","S. Media"],"industries":["Produce","Food"],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>The world-known <strong>Peroni beer</strong> has been in the Kosovar market for a while. We were selected to mark its <strong>175th anniversary</strong> through a catchy campaign in Albanian language </p>"}},{"type":"separator","data":[]},{"type":"heading","data":{"level":"h2","text":"Pa panik, plako!"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>After a provocative teaser campaign (further below), we created a promotion strategy for the 175th anniversary. Our slogans were built with a unique formula, the foundation of which was the letter P: every word of this campaign starts with this letter.</p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-9d5b9c275b.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-3d7c9261a9.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image_row","data":{"columns":1,"images":[{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-19b4d8d1b9.jpg","alt":""}]}},{"type":"separator","data":[]},{"type":"heading","data":{"level":"h2","text":"Pi çka të freskon!"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>The teaser campaign was based on rather controversial word play in social media, that soon after revealed the Peroni billboards that became viral within hours, spreading across all social media and chat rooms.</p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-261cf3b9eb.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-869b2f81c8.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-ca5383d4df.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>This campaign was launched on social media and billboards in every corner of Kosovo, that attracted huge attention even outside Kosovo's borders.</p>"}},{"type":"image_row","data":{"columns":3,"images":[{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-b33ee4cb1c.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-c2cbd1b33e.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-9d64064281.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-7ee1383303.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-5716bea595.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-39e567f0fb.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-4ed08278cf.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-28643a47c9.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-40f4ef2473.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-3344da6556.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-ab24f56af5.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-db4ebb54ab.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-8a678ca6bd.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-556e8ee2b4.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-4f3f378587.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-96e2b9920c.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-d1cbcacf93.jpg","alt":""},{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-dd928fc711.jpg","alt":""},{"ima